{"id":"n1-215","title":"～ながらも","romaji":"〜nagara mo","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'even though' or 'despite'.","longExplanation":"The ～ながらも grammar point is used to express contrast, highlighting the difference between what is usually expected from a situation and what actually happens. It can be translated as 'even though' or 'despite.'","formation":"Verb stem + ながらも, い-Adjective + ながらも, な-Adjective/Noun + ながらも","examples":[{"jp":"彼は貧しいながらも、幸せな生活を送っている。","romaji":"Kare wa mazushii nagara mo, shiawase na seikatsu o okutte iru.","en":"Despite being poor, he leads a happy life.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"貧しい","vocabId":"1490740","reading":"まずしい"},{"surface":"ながら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"幸せ","vocabId":"1594060","reading":"しあわせ"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"生活","vocabId":"1378860","reading":"せいかつ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"送っ","vocabId":"1402730","reading":"おくる","baseForm":"送る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"僕は忙しいながらも、毎日運動しています。","romaji":"Boku wa isogashii nagara mo, mainichi undou shiteimasu.","en":"Even though I am busy, I exercise every day.","words":[{"surface":"僕","vocabId":"1521400","reading":"ぼく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しい","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしい"},{"surface":"ながら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"毎日","vocabId":"1524720","reading":"まいにち"},{"surface":"運動","vocabId":"1172910","reading":"うんどう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"病気ながらも、